  "description": {
    "ja": "DeepSeek AIの推論特化モデル。2025年1月20日公開。R1-Zeroは純粋RL学習のみで推論能力を検証した初のモデル。R1はコールドスタートデータ＋RLで可読性向上。AIME 2024で79.8% Pass@1、MATH-500で97.3%達成。6種類の蒸留モデル（Qwen/Llamaベース）も提供。MITライセンス。",
    "en": "DeepSeek AI's reasoning-focused model. Released January 20, 2025. R1-Zero is the first model to verify reasoning capabilities through pure RL training. R1 improves readability via cold-start data + RL. Achieves 79.8% Pass@1 on AIME 2024 and 97.3% on MATH-500. Provides 6 distilled models (Qwen/Llama-based). MIT license."
  },
  "specs": {
    "contextLength": 128000,
    "knowledgeCutoff": "2025-Q1",
    "languages": [
      "en",
      "zh"
    ],
    "architecture": "MoE based on DeepSeek-V3, Self-verification, Reflection, Long Chain-of-Thought generation, Maximum generation length 32,768 tokens",
    "promptTemplate": {
      "format": "deepseek-r1",
      "user": "<｜begin▁of▁sentence｜><｜User｜>{user_message}<｜Assistant｜><｜think｜>",
      "assistant": "{reasoning_process}\n<｜/think｜>\n\n{final_answer}<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>",
      "stopTokens": [
        "<｜end▁of▁sentence｜>"
      ]
    }
  },
